Experiment: Digital Forensics using Autopsy (Kali Linux)
🎯 Aim

To perform digital forensic analysis on a disk image using Autopsy in Kali Linux and study the process of extracting digital evidence.

🎯 Objectives
To understand digital forensics concepts
To analyze disk images using Autopsy
To study file system structure
To recover deleted files
To examine user activity and artifacts
To understand forensic investigation workflow
🧠 Concept (Short for Viva)

Digital Forensics is the process of:

Collecting
Preserving
Analyzing
Reporting digital evidence

Autopsy:

GUI-based forensic tool
Built on Sleuth Kit
Works on disk images
Recovers deleted files and user activity
